的市场让他短暂“担忧”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump says Wednesday's market had him briefly 'concerned' before stocks recovered&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOWHRXZnN1TmZVRDJ6VUJtNjhuRm85eGlQVmdGNGQ0SC0yeHlPVUlKSksyLVNZa0VqRGdqUWVtaW1oNHhjQldDdHlKYnZ0TVgtbkpEcmJfVEcyTUxnNkNYeEdaYXlWUmQwcnhyLUtrUERoYnhIdnVxV3lFeUhza21Wc3U2WW9yd2loWmpxeXE4SG9OT2Rlai1reWtSemRkYnlBZndLaFVNOHJHeDF4ZkVmckpqSzZSbElNZHpfdUFLTTBsOW9C?oc=5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:25:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</link><description>日本烟草公司股价上涨，此前有消息称该卷烟制造商正在探索与奥驰亚集团公司收购帝国品牌公司的可能性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover'&gt;日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan Tobacco Shares Climb on Potential Imperial Brands Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:26:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 爱荷华州爆炸后，一家人聚集在一起度过一个不寻常的感恩节</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-detonation-family-thanksgiving.html</link><description>一家弹药厂爆炸后的第二天，一家人聚集在爱荷华州东南部的一座农舍里。感觉就像一场暴风雨过去了。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-detonation-family-thanksgiving.html'&gt;爱荷华州爆炸后，一家人聚集在一起度过一个不寻常的感恩节&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：After the Iowa Detonation, a Family Gathered for an Unusual Thanksgiving&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-detonation-family-thanksgiving.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:33:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 日本 GPIF 将介绍每项资产组合审查，而不仅仅是部分审查</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-gpif-to-brief-on-every-asset-mix-review-not-just-some</link><description>日本政府养老金投资基金现在向董事会报告其战略资产配置的每次审查结果，而不是仅在认为有必要时才报告。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-gpif-to-brief-on-every-asset-mix-review-not-just-some'&gt;日本 GPIF 将介绍每项资产组合审查，而不仅仅是部分审查&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan GPIF to Brief on Every Asset-Mix Review, Not Just Some&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-gpif-to-brief-on-every-asset-mix-review-not-just-some</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:34:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Assets Rally After Lula Names Banker as Finance Minister&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 国际货币基金组织敦促澳大利亚央行准备好在物价恶化时进一步收紧货币政策</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-urges-rba-to-be-ready-to-tighten-further-if-prices-worsen</link><description>国际货币基金组织表示，如果价格压力更加持续，澳大利亚货币当局应做好进一步加息的准备，同时呼吁政府兑现收紧财政政策的承诺。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-urges-rba-to-be-ready-to-tighten-further-if-prices-worsen'&gt;国际货币基金组织敦促澳大利亚央行准备好在物价恶化时进一步收紧货币政策&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：IMF Urges RBA to Be Ready to Tighten Further If Prices Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-urges-rba-to-be-ready-to-tighten-further-if-prices-worsen</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:10:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 据报道韩国正在考虑扩大股票稳定基金</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund</link><description>据《每日经济新闻》报道，随着当局准备在波动加剧的情况下进行干预，韩国正在考虑扩大其 10.76 万亿韩元（80 亿美元）的股市稳定基金。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund'&gt;据报道韩国正在考虑扩大股票稳定基金&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Korea Reportedly Mulls Expanding Stock Stabilization Fund&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:22:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 10月份中国工业利润增速飙升至5个月新高20.1%</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/27/china-industrial-profits-october.html</link><description>中国经济一直以两种速度运行，人工智能相关的制造业和出口推动增长，而家庭消费却一直滞后。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/27/china-industrial-profits-october.html'&gt;10月份中国工业利润增速飙升至5个月新高20.1%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China industrial profits growth surges to a 5-month high of 20.1% in October&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/27/china-industrial-profits-october.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:38:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 波动性如何破坏套利交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video</link><description>投资者借入日元、欧元和美元等货币的套利交易在今年早些时候带来强劲回报后变得越来越难操作。彭博社的加菲猫雷诺兹讨论了市场变化如何影响该策略的吸引力。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video'&gt;波动性如何破坏套利交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Volatility is Undermining the Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:40:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 新西兰执政联盟仅落后议会多数席位一个席位</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c670278qk879o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>国家党领导的右倾执政集团未能获得执政所需的多数席位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c670278qk879o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;新西兰执政联盟仅落后议会多数席位一个席位&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：New Zealand's ruling coalition falls short of parliamentary majority by one seat&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c670278qk879o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:45:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[华尔街日报] 新西兰选举陷入僵局，局外人变成拥王者</title><link>https://www.wsj.com/world/asia/new-zealand-election-ends-in-deadlock-turns-outsider-into-kingmaker-b1708432?mod=rss_worldnews</link><description>总理克里斯托弗·卢克森 (Christopher Luxon) 需要新人秋莱·王 (Qiulae Wong) 领导的机会党的支持才能组建多数政府。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[华尔街日报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.wsj.com/world/asia/new-zealand-election-ends-in-deadlock-turns-outsider-into-kingmaker-